# Nightly build blocklist
#
# Policy: by default nightly images are built only for platinum targets. Every
# other Supported (.conf) board is listed below so the nightly generator skips
# it.
#
# This is NOT a strict criteria: any standard Supported (.conf) board can have
# nightly enabled - just remove it from this list (a maintainer/user can propose
# that with a PR). Platinum is only the default set; being off this list is what
# turns nightly on, platinum or not.
#
# Not listed on purpose:
#   - csc / tvb boards: community tier, never in the nightly (conf+wip) universe.
#   - virtual/reusable boards (release-targets/reusable.yml): download remaps,
#     not build targets.
#
